              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kei 18:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno tic ceke m’ubimo ma Suleman utimo i ot pa Yehova thum. Man Suleman ukelo gin ma Daudi ma won uthiero, en e mola ma tar, ku mola ma kwar, kud agulu, man ekethogi i kakanpiny mi ot pa Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
